<%# The live refreshes every page of one host listens to (#194, FleetBroadcast): this host's changes, its tasks'
    changes, and changes for every host. Not the fleet stream, so another host's change does not refresh it. The
    ids name the host, so Turbo never carries one host's subscription over to another host's page. %>
<%= turbo_stream_from FleetBroadcast.host_stream(host.id), id: "host_stream_#{host.id}", data: { turbo_permanent: true } %>
<%= turbo_stream_from FleetBroadcast::ALL_HOSTS_STREAM, id: "all_hosts_stream", data: { turbo_permanent: true } %>
